# The frontend needs no environment variables.
# Never put model API keys into VITE_* variables: they are bundled into the client.
#
# The photo-analysis key is a SERVER secret for the Cloudflare Pages Function:
#   production: Cloudflare dashboard → homeestet → Settings → Variables and secrets → ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (Secret)
#   local:      .dev.vars (see .dev.vars.example)
